	<names>
		<name lang="en">EK1322 2-port EtherCAT P junction with feed-in</name>
		<name lang="fr">EK1322 2-port EtherCAT P junction with feed-in</name>
	</names>
	<elementInformations>
		<elementInformation name="manufacturer" show="1">Beckhoff</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="manufacturer_reference" show="1">EK1322</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="designation" show="1">2-port EtherCAT P junction with feed-in</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="description" show="1">EtherCAT P junction for the EtherCAT Terminal segment. Generic layout: one EtherCAT P input and two EtherCAT P outputs named after the usual X50, X51 and X52 of the EtherCAT P boxes; check the exact ports of your device in its datasheet.</elementInformation>
	</elementInformations>
	<informations>Author: QElectroTech contributors
Generic layout, not copied from a manufacturer drawing. License: see http://qelectrotech.org/wiki/doc/elements_license
Schematic view made by misc/beckhoff/gen_couplers.py from the realistic view: the stages are generic, check them against the datasheet. License: see http://qelectrotech.org/wiki/doc/elements_license
The +24 V and 0 V rails stand for the power contacts (generic).</informations>
